219 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 117 0 R
/E (Notice: A team member who wishes to step down must give at least one month's written notice. During this period, they must hand over their responsibilities to another team member. )
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
220 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 117 0 R
/E (Approval of roles: Only the Founder/CEO, on the recommendation of the Human Resource Manager, may approve or change a team member's role. Any change must be in writing. )
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
221 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 117 0 R
/E (Probation: New team members begin with a three-month probation period. At the end of it, the company will decide whether to confirm the team member in their role. Benefits: There are currently no fixed benefits attached to volunteering. The Founder/CEO or team head may, at their discretion, grant privileges from company funds. Such privileges are not a right, may be withdrawn, and do not create any expectation of future benefits. )
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
