/E (This handbook explains the policies, expectations, and standards that guide team members at The Relevant Woman. It is a general guide, not an exhaustive one, and cannot cover every situation. This handbook is not a contract. It does not create an employment relationship, and it does not guarantee any role, position, or length of service. The company may update, add to, or withdraw any policy at any time. Where possible, team members will be told about changes. If this handbook conflicts with a more recent company policy, the more recent policy applies. This handbook replaces any earlier guidelines for team members. )
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [13]
>>
